    "overview": "IM Review's shipped UI is a quiet, dense desktop tool surface: Inter + Tailwind neutrals, light paper backgrounds, flat bordered lists, and sparse amber/emerald/red status accents. It prioritizes scanability of PR queues and review workflows over brand theater. Depth comes from borders and tonal surfaces, not shadows or gradients.",
